        "node_id": "n_7_5fa388",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous reasoning was that it didn't account for the parameters in the instructions. Let's refine the thought process:\n\nThought-2 (refined): Count the number of instructions and calculate the total memory used, including parameters. Then, determine how many NOP instructions are needed to align the program to 4-byte boundaries, considering that each instruction takes at least one byte and can have additional bytes for parameters.",
